#EXTM3U
# nothing-htpc curated cable lineup.
# Format: tvg-chno = the channel number on your "cable box".
# Numbers are stable — add channels at any free number, gaps are fine.
# An entry with no number is skipped, never auto-assigned: the whole point of
# tvg-chno is that 3 is always Sitel.
#
# 990-999 used to be reserved for teletext. Teletext is gone (July 2026) and
# those numbers are simply free — NEWS, WEATHER, MOVIES and SHOWS are screens
# in the launcher now, not channels.
#
# Sources: iptv-org (github.com/iptv-org/iptv), Free-TV/IPTV, and the
# broadcasters' own CDNs. Paste me more m3u playlists in chat and I'll extract
# and merge them here.
#
# --- how this file is maintained -------------------------------------------
#
# Every URL below was probed from the Fedora laptop on 13 Aug 2026 and answered
# with a playlist, a variant AND a segment. That last part is the one that
# matters: a master playlist over a dead origin returns 200 and shows black,
# which is indistinguishable from a broken box at the sofa.
#
# A channel with no working source has its URL commented out rather than left
# to rot. The number and the name stay as a placeholder, so the dial keeps its
# shape and the entry is one uncommented line away from being back.
# server/channels.py skips an #EXTINF whose URL is commented, so a reserved
# number costs nothing and never shows up as a black channel.
#
# The lineup is deliberately geo-free: everything here answers from an ordinary
# European connection with no VPN, no user-agent games and no referrer header.
# Streams that only worked with a browser user-agent were rejected rather than
# worked around — mpv would need the header carried through this file, and the
# channel would break again the next time the operator tightened it.

# ============================================================================
# 1-29   MACEDONIA
# ============================================================================
#
# The bad news first: the vipottbpkstream.vip.hr CDN, which carried eight of
# these (MRT 2, Alsat, TV21, Shenja, MTM, Sobraniski, ERA, Sutel), now refuses
# connections outright — not a geo-block, the host is simply gone. teve.mk's
# s1/s2 subdomains went with it; the apex still works. This is constraint 18 in
# the ordinary course of business, which is why it costs comments and not a
# rebuild.

#EXTINF:-1 tvg-chno="1",MRT 1
