# 30-39  GREECE
# ============================================================================
#
# ERT1, ERT2 and ERT3 are genuinely geo-fenced: their CDN 307s to msvdn.net,
# which answers 401 "Content blocked by security policy" from outside Greece.
# ERT News on the same CDN is open, which is how you can tell it is policy
# rather than breakage. ANT1 works unauthenticated despite iptv-org marking it
# geo-blocked.

